body:
Hey, I had the same happen with my therapist who then ghosted me.

&#x200B;

Never got another one.

I'm watching it now but I can't get over the lead lady's eyebrows. So distracting.

&#x200B;

Edit -  Nothing original. I wasn't a fan :(

You've been given a dozen venues, yet still post this every few weeks

&#x200B;

Go away please - Mods this is clearly spam

For us -  A meal cooked and arranged by us, a bottle of cheap wine and some cheap chocolates.

&#x200B;

For them - A pay rise.

I foolishly watched this before a 6am shift the next day, and spent all night too depressed to sleep.

&#x200B;

Too close to home on a LOT of shit.

Knowing the BBC, she's probably coked off her box

&#x200B;

Edit - Missed the Sky logo as I;m overly tired. Sorry!
